WEBVTT

00:00:01.675 --> 00:00:03.719
Hagrid: Harry! Harry!

00:00:04.095 --> 00:00:06.472
Happy birthday.

00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:09.016
Harry:

00:00:13.604 --> 00:00:17.108
You all right, Harry?
You seem very quiet.

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:23.030
He killed my parents, didn't he?
The one who gave me this.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.867
You know, Hagrid. I know you do.

00:00:30.788 --> 00:00:35.334
First, and understand this
because it's very important:

00:00:35.543 --> 00:00:38.045
Not all wizards are good.

00:00:38.295 --> 00:00:40.798
Some of them go bad.
A few years ago...

00:00:41.006 --> 00:00:46.011
There was a wizard who went as bad
as you can go. His name was v...

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:49.849
- His name was v...
- Maybe if you wrote it down?

00:00:50.057 --> 00:00:51.892
No, I can't spell it.

00:00:52.143 --> 00:00:56.397
- All right, Voldemort.
- Voldemort?

00:00:56.564 --> 00:00:59.024
Shh.

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:02.570
It was dark times, Harry.

00:01:04.905 --> 00:01:08.033
Voldemort started
to gather some followers.

00:01:08.284 --> 00:01:11.579
Brought them over to the dark side.

00:01:12.997 --> 00:01:16.083
Anyone that stood up to him
ended up dead.

00:01:17.251 --> 00:01:20.296
Your parents fought against him.

00:01:20.504 --> 00:01:24.300
But nobody lived once
he decided to kill them.

00:01:28.679 --> 00:01:31.265
Nobody, not one.

00:01:31.432 --> 00:01:33.851
Except you.

00:01:35.853 --> 00:01:39.940
Me? Voldemort tried to kill me?

00:01:40.441 --> 00:01:44.612
Yes. That ain't no ordinary cut
on your forehead, Harry.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:50.618
A Mark like that only comes from being
touched by a curse, an evil curse.

00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:54.455
What happened to v...?
To you-know-who?

00:01:55.623 --> 00:01:58.959
Well, some say he died.

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:01.629
Codswallop, in my opinion.

00:02:01.837 --> 00:02:05.090
Nope, I reckon he's out there still...

00:02:05.299 --> 00:02:08.260
Too tired to carry on.

00:02:08.469 --> 00:02:13.891
But one thing's certain. Something
about you stumped him that night.

00:02:14.141 --> 00:02:18.395
That's why you're famous.
That's why everybody knows your name.

00:02:18.854 --> 00:02:22.483
You're the boy who lived.

00:02:31.867 --> 00:02:34.578
What are you looking at?

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.332
Blimey, is that the time?

00:02:38.499 --> 00:02:42.503
I'm gonna have to leave you.
Dumbledore will be wanting his...

00:02:42.753 --> 00:02:47.633
Well, he'll be wanting to see me.
Your train leaves in 10 minutes.

00:02:47.841 --> 00:02:53.180
Here's your ticket. Stick to your ticket,
that's very important.

